  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project to Improve the Provincial Route 82 Corridor in the Province of Mendoza</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Proyecto de mejora del corredor de la ruta provincial No. 82, Provincia de Mendoza</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir a incrementar la productividad de la economa de laPdM, a travs de la mejora de la infraestructura vial y turstica. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) contribuir a la mejora dela calidad de circulacin y de la seguridad vial, a travs del aumento de capacidad, la rehabilitacin y mejora del corredorde la Ruta Provincial N82, lo que resultar en la reduccin de costos de operacin, de tiempos promedio de viaje y de latasa de siniestros viales; y (ii) contribuir a mejorar la competitividad turstica del rea Cacheuta a travs de intervencionesde infraestructura urbana y del fortalecimiento de la capacidad de gestin territorial y de turismo de dicho distrito.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the project is to help boost the productivity of the economy of the province of Mendoza by improving road and tourism infrastructure. The specific objectives are: (i) to help improve the quality of traffic flow and road safety by increasing capacity, rehabilitating, and upgrading the Provincial Route 82 corridor, which will result in reduced operating costs, shorter average travel times, and lower road accident rates; and(ii) to help improve the tourism competitiveness of the Cacheuta district through interventions in urban infrastructure and capacity-building in land use and tourism management in this district.</narrative>
  </description>
